# The typst export re-encodes every image a document uses next to the PDF, one file per use, so
# brand/logo.png arrives here three times. The PDF is the deliverable and stays tracked; these are
# copies of a tracked source, and committing them would put the same pixels in the repo four times.
examples/exports/paper-*.png
